ow"><span>Minimum habitability</span><strong>25%</strong></div><div class="row"><span>Colony cap</span><strong>10</strong></div><p class="permission">authenticated commander · colonization eligibility · resource validation</p></div><div class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">BIOME PROFILE</div><h2>Applied modifiers</h2><div class="row"><span>Metal modifier</span><strong>'+fmt(sel.metal_modifier||1)+'×</strong></div><div class="row"><span>Crystal modifier</span><strong>'+fmt(sel.crystal_modifier||1)+'×</strong></div><div class="row"><span>Naquadah modifier</span><strong>'+fmt(sel.naquadah_modifier||1)+'×</strong></div><div class="row"><span>Energy modifier</span><strong>'+fmt(sel.energy_modifier||1)+'×</strong></div><div class="row"><span>Moons</span><strong>'+fmt((sel.moons||[]).length)+'</strong></div></div><div class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">COLONIZATION STATUS</div><h2>Planet settlement readiness</h2><p class="permission">Inspect mapped worlds and review their biome, habitability, capacity, occupancy, and life-support profile before committing a colony expedition.</p><span class="badge good">SERVER VERIFIED</span> <span class="badge">ELIGIBILITY CHECK ACTIVE</span><details style="margin-top:14px"><summary>Technical details</summary><p class="permission">Actions: <code>planet_details</code> / <code>colonize_planet</code>. Inspection is read-scoped; colonization validates ownership, occupancy, habitability, colony capacity, resources, cooldown, and transaction state on the server.</p>'+['universe_planets','player_colonies','planet_bonuses','player_resources','player_cooldowns','game_events'].map(x=>'<span class="badge">'+x+'</span> ').join('')+'<div style="margin-top:12px">'+['ready','empty','protected','insufficient-resource','success','error'].map(x=>'<div class="row"><span>'+x+'</span><span class="badge">HANDLED</span></div>').join('')+'</div></details></div><div class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">FEEDBACK STATES</div><h2>Result handling</h2>'+['read