v><p class="permission">Gate access requires a discovered system and an active moon gate. Fleet authority is checked server-side.</p><div class="eyebrow">ANOMALY CONTROL</div><h2>Explore anomaly</h2><form method="post" action="actions/game.php">'+csrf+'<input type="hidden" name="action" value="explore"><input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="solar-systems"><input type="hidden" name="system_id" value="'+fmt(sys.id||0)+'"><button class="button" type="submit" '+(!sys.id||cd.state==='cooldown'?'disabled':'')+'>Explore anomaly</button></form><div class="row"><span>Cooldown</span><span class="badge '+(cd.state==='ready'?'good':'')+'">'+esc(cd.state||'ready')+'</span></div></div><div class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">FLEET LANES</div><h2>System traffic</h2>'+(laneRows||'<p class="permission">No active fleet lanes currently resolve to this system.</p>')+'</div><div class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">FEEDBACK STATES</div><h2>Result handling</h2>'+['ready','empty','protected','error'].map(x=>'<div class="row"><span>'+x+'</span><span class="badge">HANDLED</span></div>').join('')+'</div><div class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">SYSTEM NAVIGATION STATUS</div><h2>System route ready</h2><p class="permission">Your selected solar system is ready for inspection. Fleet lanes, jump-gate access, scan telemetry, discovery results, and anomaly rewards are resolved securely by the game server.</p><span class="badge good">SERVER VERIFIED</span> <span class="badge">ANOMALY SCAN READY</span><details style="margin-top:14px"><summary>Technical details</summary><p class="permission">Actions: <code>system_map</code> / <code>explore</code>. Coordinate validation, discovery, gate availability, scan telemetry, anomaly rewards, cooldowns, and persistence are authoritative on the server.</p>'+['universe_solar_systems','universe_planets','universe_moons','universe_discoveries','fleet_missions','player_cooldowns','player_resources','game_events'].map(x=>'<span class="badge">'+x+'</span> '