bility · scan cooldown · systems are ordered by risk and strategic value.</p></div><div class="card side-card"><div class="eyebrow">SCAN MODEL</div><h2>Scan results</h2><div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric"><span>Sensor range</span><strong>'+fmt(scan.sensor_range||0)+'</strong><small>Hull + shield + sensor modules</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Mothership science</span><strong>'+fmt(scan.mothership_science||0)+'</strong><small>Exploration and module science</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Scan technology</span><strong>'+fmt(scan.scan_technology||0)+'</strong><small>Sensor/navigation technology</small></div></div><div class="row"><span>Scan power</span><strong>'+fmt(scan.power||0)+'</strong></div><div class="row"><span>Cooldown</span><span class="badge '+(cd.state==='ready'?'good':'')+'">'+esc(cd.state||'ready')+'</span></div></div><div class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">SECTOR OVERVIEW</div><h2>'+esc(sec.name||'No accessible sector')+'</h2><div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric"><span>Sector class</span><strong>'+esc(sec.sector_class||'—')+'</strong><small>Danger level '+fmt(sec.danger_level||0)+'</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Resource modifier</span><strong>'+Number(sec.resource_modifier||1).toFixed(2)+'×</strong><small>Anomaly rate '+Math.round(Number(sec.anomaly_rate||0)*100)+'%</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Travel lanes</span><strong>'+fmt(s.travel_lanes||0)+'</strong><small>Ordered system routes</small></div></div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Planets</th><th>Owner signals</th><th>Risk</th><th>Strategic value</th><th>Owner signal</th><th>Travel lane</th><th>Scan</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+(rows||'<tr><td colspan="8">No accessible solar systems in this sector.</td></tr>')+'</tbody></table></div><div class="card side-card"><div class="eyebrow">OWNER SIGNALS</div><h2>Signal analysis</h2><div class="row"><span>Colony signals</span><strong>'+fmt(s.owner_signals||0)+'</strong></div><div class="row">